Subject: [PATCH 5/9] Page-bounded REP string operations

Base-commit: 14c92681f4d62cf84d901460e0358de09c8847a7
Prerequisites: five pinned Hadron patches, local/0001 and local/0002,
and all earlier numbered patches in this series.

Apply local/0003 through local/0011 in Portfile order before building.
Shared declarations and frontend/backend changes cross patch boundaries;
individual patches are not standalone builds.

Bound REP string operations by page boundaries.
The existing Wine ABI, 64KB guards and default settings are preserved.
The iOS-only relocated guest window has been removed.
Rebuild and install both PE DLLs and native Unix helpers together.

